---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms of Service — CenterGrade App" description="CenterGrade App Terms of Service. Review the terms and conditions for using the CenterGrade App trading card centering measurement app.">
  <Nav />
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 md:py-24">

    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8">Terms of Service</h1>
    <p class="mb-8 text-sm" style="color: #8B8FA3;">Last Updated: February 27, 2026</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Acceptance of Terms</h2>
    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: #8B8FA3;">By downloading or using CenterGrade App ("the app"), you agree to these terms of service.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Description of Service</h2>
    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: #8B8FA3;">CenterGrade App is a trading card centering measurement tool that uses your device's camera or photo library to analyze card centering and provide estimated grade predictions. All image processing is performed on your device. The app uses Firebase Analytics by Google to collect anonymous usage data, including app interactions, device information, and crash reports, to help improve app performance and user experience. The app is provided for informational and entertainment purposes only.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Free and Pro Tiers</h2>
    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: #8B8FA3;">The app is available as a free download with optional Pro upgrade. Feature availability varies by tier:</p>

    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: #8B8FA3;"><strong class="text-text-primary">Free tier includes:</strong></p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4" style="color: #8B8FA3;">
      <li class="mb-2">Unlimited card scans</li>
      <li class="mb-2">PSA and BGS grade predictions</li>
      <li class="mb-2">Up to 10 scans saved in history</li>
      <li class="mb-2">Shareable result cards with CenterGrade App branding</li>
      <li class="mb-2">Rewarded video ads to temporarily unlock premium predictions</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: #8B8FA3;"><strong class="text-text-primary">Pro tier ($4.99 one-time purchase) adds:</strong></p>
    <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mb-4" style="color: #8B8FA3;">
      <li class="mb-2">CGC, SGC, ACE, and TAG grade predictions</li>
      <li class="mb-2">Unlimited scan history</li>
      <li class="mb-2">HD image capture (4224x2376)</li>
      <li class="mb-2">Ad-free experience</li>
      <li class="mb-2">Advanced adjustment tools (fine mode, guide color picker, extended zoom)</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: #8B8FA3;">Feature availability may change with future updates.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Grade Predictions Disclaimer</h2>
    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: #8B8FA3;">Grade predictions provided by the app are <strong class="text-text-primary">estimates only</strong> and should not be considered guarantees of actual grades from any grading service. Actual grades from PSA, BGS, CGC, SGC, ACE, TAG, or any other grading company may differ from the app's predictions.</p>
    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: #8B8FA3;">Prediction accuracy depends on factors including image quality, lighting conditions, card positioning, and manual adjustments made by the user. We make no warranty regarding the accuracy of any prediction.</p>
    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: #8B8FA3;">We are not affiliated with, endorsed by, or associated with any grading company.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Advertising</h2>
    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: #8B8FA3;">The free version of the app displays advertisements provided by Google AdMob, including banner ads, interstitial ads, and rewarded video ads. Ad content is determined by Google and is subject to <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="color: #00D4AA;" class="hover:underline">Google's Terms of Service</a>. You may remove all ads by purchasing the Pro upgrade.</p>

    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mt-6 mb-3">Rewarded Video Ads</h3>
    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: #8B8FA3;">Free users may watch a rewarded video ad to temporarily unlock premium grade predictions (CGC, SGC, ACE, TAG) for the current scan only. This unlock does not persist to future scans and is subject to ad availability. We do not guarantee that rewarded ads will always be available.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">In-App Purchases</h2>
    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: #8B8FA3;">The app offers optional in-app purchases including a Pro upgrade and tip jar. All purchases are processed through Apple's App Store and are subject to Apple's terms and conditions. The Pro upgrade is a one-time, non-consumable purchase that unlocks premium features permanently. Refund requests should be directed to Apple.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Shared Content</h2>
    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: #8B8FA3;">The app allows you to generate and share card analysis images ("share cards"). You retain ownership of your card images. By using the share feature, you acknowledge that shared images may contain the app's branding and measurement data.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Intellectual Property</h2>
    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: #8B8FA3;">The app and its original content, features, and functionality are owned by the developer. Grading company names (PSA, BGS, CGC, SGC, ACE, TAG) are trademarks of their respective owners and are used for informational purposes only.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Limitation of Liability</h2>
    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: #8B8FA3;">The app is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind, either express or implied. We are not liable for any damages arising from the use of the app, including but not limited to decisions made based on the app's grade predictions, centering measurements, or any other output.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Termination</h2>
    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: #8B8FA3;">We reserve the right to terminate or suspend access to the app at any time, without notice, for any reason.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Changes to Terms</h2>
    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: #8B8FA3;">We may update these terms from time to time. Continued use of the app after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold mt-8 mb-4">Contact</h2>
    <p class="mb-4 leading-relaxed" style="color: #8B8FA3;">If you have questions about these terms, please contact us at <a href="mailto:centergradeapp@proton.me" style="color: #00D4AA;" class="hover:underline">centergradeapp@proton.me</a>.</p>

  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
